<title>AUSTRIA: Austria's BBAG sees rise in 1996 pre-tax.</title>
<headline>Austria's BBAG sees rise in 1996 pre-tax.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian drinks group Oesterreichische Brau Beteiligungs AG (BBAG) said on Thursday its 1996 pre-tax profit should rise to around one billion schillings from 770.9 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Chief executive Johannes Brandl told a news conference that pre-tax profit would reach &quot;approximately one billion schillings&quot; and said operating earnings should exceed 500 million schillings. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
